{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼宣佈，《GTA6》已成為PlayStation商店歷史上數字預購量最高的遊戲。面對「前所未有」的需求，索尼與R星決定把預載時間提前至發售前九天，方便玩家在遊戲解鎖後直接進入。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585858.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T22:48:21.847070+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T22:30:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T22:41:41.006053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T22:41:41.006053+00:00","content_hash":"8df0ddf68f639609855713eec638dca92742d1b7fc96e0d2a5e8aeba0a7efe00","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}